A model PixelKit trains is a modified version of the YOLOX network and,
when its weights descend from Megvii's COCO checkpoint, directly or through
an earlier run, of Megvii's weights. Each exported model ships with a
NOTICE.txt and a copy of the Apache License, Version 2.0; keep both with
the model when you share it.
